  "prefLabel": "Puc 2201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2201.01 Purpose. The purpose of Puc 2200 is to implement the provisions of RSA 53-E to provide for implementation and operation of community power aggregation programs and their interactions with electric distribution utilities.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
